I do that with my body as well.

00:27:12.700 --> 00:27:13.840
It's all an experiment.

00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:15.690
But let's go through the diets.

00:27:15.690 --> 00:27:19.700
Okay, so there's a fasting mimicking diet,

00:27:19.700 --> 00:27:22.970
Valter Longo, colleague of mine from UCLA

00:27:23.830 --> 00:27:24.820
