00:35:14.260 --> 00:35:17.120
That's not true, it can
depend on your genetics.

00:35:17.120 --> 00:35:19.970
And we've now learned
that some strains of mice

00:35:19.970 --> 00:35:22.630
and probably humans as well
are much more sensitive

00:35:22.630 --> 00:35:24.930
to this diet, these types of diets.

00:35:24.930 --> 00:35:26.860
And you probably want
to do it a little less

00:35:26.860 --> 00:35:28.320
than someone else.

00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:30.940
And you only know that if you try

00:35:30.940 --> 00:35:32.760
it on yourself and measure things.

00:35:32.760 --> 00:35:34.940
- I like this idea that
