00:37:53.530 --> 00:37:54.630
- Right.
- After 20 minutes.

00:37:54.630 --> 00:37:55.880
- So, there's an interesting story

00:37:55.880 --> 00:37:57.290
about the role of protein and hunger.

00:37:57.290 --> 00:38:00.570
And it was first discovered
by a friend of mine,

00:38:00.570 --> 00:38:02.280
Stephen Simpson in Australia,

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:03.800
and he was studying locusts.

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:05.690
And he found out that what turns a locust

00:38:05.690 --> 00:38:08.130
into a swarm was a lack of protein.

00:38:08.130 --> 00:38:11.290
And when they get too low in
protein, they go crazy on.

00:38:11.290 --> 00:38:12.340
- Locusts get hangry.

00:38:13.340 --> 00:38:15.070
- And they start eating
each other, it's that bad.

00:38:15.070 --> 00:38:17.460
- Yeah, and everything
else in their sight.

00:38:17.460 --> 00:38:19.000
- Yeah, and we even see this in the mice

00:38:19.000 --> 00:38:21.330
that we have on low protein diets,

00:38:21.330 --> 00:38:24.270
they get super mad and they
even attack each other.

00:38:24.270 --> 00:38:26.700
So you don't want to
be too low in anything.

00:38:26.700 --> 00:38:28.080
You don't want to be hangry.

00:38:28.080 --> 00:38:31.130
But getting back to what
really works for me is,

00:38:31.130 --> 00:38:32.920
I've trained my liver
