00:41:16.890 --> 00:41:17.723
- Well, why?

00:41:17.723 --> 00:41:18.556
Well, there are two reasons

00:41:18.556 --> 00:41:20.530
that glucose is bad when it spikes,

00:41:20.530 --> 00:41:21.880
three, if you include the brain fog

00:41:21.880 --> 00:41:23.880
but let's just talk about physiology here.

00:41:23.880 --> 00:41:26.540
One is, that you're going
to have glucose attached

00:41:26.540 --> 00:41:29.050
to proteins that makes them glom up.

00:41:29.050 --> 00:41:31.350
Think of it like caramelized body parts.

00:41:31.350 --> 00:41:33.720
This'll ultimately lower your longevity.

00:41:33.720 --> 00:41:36.620
Reduce your longevity,
give you type two diabetes

00:41:36.620 --> 00:41:39.060
and probably cardiovascular
disease on top of that.

00:41:39.060 --> 00:41:40.770
So that's one, keep those
glucose levels down.

00:41:40.770 --> 00:41:43.940
But also, what glucose is
going to be doing to you

00:41:43.940 --> 00:41:47.110
at high levels, is shutting off
those protective mechanisms.

00:41:47.110 --> 00:41:50.410
Remember, particularly
AMPK and the sirtuins.

00:41:50.410 --> 00:41:52.660
They get switched off by sugar.

00:41:52.660 --> 00:41:54.410
So, by having that up for most of the day,

00:41:54.410 --> 00:41:56.410
if you're eating three meals plus snacks,

00:41:56.410 --> 00:41:58.210
your defenses against disease

00:41:58.210 --> 00:42:01.370
and aging are going to
be working at a minimum.

00:42:01.370 --> 00:42:04.720
So instead, keep those glucose
levels low and consistent.

00:42:04.720 --> 00:42:06.320
You won't get the brain fog,

00:42:06.320 --> 00:42:10.520
you'll get fewer proteins
modified that'll lead to disease.

00:42:10.520 --> 00:42:12.240
And thirdly, importantly,

00:42:12.240 --> 00:42:13.700
you'll actually stimulate your body's

00:42:13.700 --> 00:42:16.200
natural defenses against
disease and aging.

00:42:16.200 --> 00:42:19.960
- So, the first step, sugars,

00:42:19.960 --> 00:42:21.750
let's get rid of the sugar.
