01:06:06.580 --> 01:06:07.600
that we've published.

01:06:07.600 --> 01:06:08.533
When we were,

01:06:09.960 --> 01:06:11.650
going back probably a
hundred thousand years ago,

01:06:11.650 --> 01:06:12.950
