01:06:12.950 --> 01:06:14.400
What was our lifestyle?

01:06:14.400 --> 01:06:15.740
We were cold and hungry.

01:06:15.740 --> 01:06:18.740
These days we live in air
conditioned and heated houses

01:06:18.740 --> 01:06:20.430
with food always available,

01:06:20.430 --> 01:06:23.750
